 223          /* Function Name:
 224           *      _rtk_port_FiberModeAbility_set
 225           * Description:
 226           *      Set ethernet PHY auto-negotiation desired ability.
 227           * Input:
 228           *      port        - port id.
 229           *      pAbility    - Ability structure
 230           * Output:
 231           *      None
 232           * Return:
 233           *      RT_ERR_OK               - OK
